  "gaps": [
    "Gem Pal artwork is packaged as maximum-768px WebP display derivatives (quality 90) of the original images. Full-resolution pixel inspection is outside this compact artifact; UI_REVIEW_EXACT_ASSETS=1 retains original bytes. Other artwork, fonts and UI source are unchanged.",
    "AI replies and remote build lifecycle are deterministic synthetic responses. No model, spending, authentication or server behavior is exercised.",
    "Generated-game preview uses a clearly labelled embedded transport fixture; generated-game artwork and arbitrary generated gameplay are not represented. Native games use the represented source engines.",
    "Pre-K and Kindergarten use the early-preview compile mode; they are not enabled in the ordinary production build.",
    "No separate scene-preview approval screen was found at the initial merged game-creation baseline. Existing coding scene preview and coach readiness are retained.",
    "Family-beta server welcome, account recovery and administrator routes are outside this standalone frontend harness; use the separate beta acceptance for those routes.",
    "Browser speech, microphone capture, service worker, external links and real authentication are disabled. Passphrases entered here have no authority; use only demo text.",
    "Scenario controls affect fixture initialization and service responses; they do not claim every possible page/scenario cross-product is implemented.",
    "Review navigation can dismiss active learning or dialogs to reach a requested state; normal in-app navigation retains its existing guards.",
    "Local synthetic IndexedDB storage is isolated by a review-run prefix. Review findings persist separately where browser storage permits, with explicit JSON and Markdown exports.",
    "Mobile/tablet viewport emulation does not establish real hardware, Safari, touch keyboard, sound or educational acceptance."
  ],
